{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23127","headline":"初除主客郎中知制诰与王十一李七元九三舍人中书同宿话旧感怀 · 白居易","name":"初除主客郎中知制诰与王十一李七元九三舍人中书同宿话旧感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲宵静话喜还悲，聚散穷通不自知。\n已分云泥行异路，忽惊鸡鹤宿同枝。\n紫垣曹署荣华地，白发郎官老丑时。\n莫怪不如君气味，此中来校十年迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}